  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0"><name>Context</name><text>This dashboard collects the current WFE scaffold IOC families under by_pip2_iocs. Scraper now exposes provisional position, location, bias, and current fields; RPU and ACCT expose current plus pairwise differential-current readbacks derived in the IOC for Phoebus/operator review.</text><x>20</x><y>58</y><width>950</width><height>52</height><font><font family="Liberation Sans" style="REGULAR" size="12.0"></font></font><horizontal_alignment>0</horizontal_alignment><vertical_alignment>1</vertical_alignment><wrap_words>true</wrap_words><actions></actions></widget>
